00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:29.440
In your tools folder, the same way we'll have all the tools that you might want to reuse

72
00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.119
across many crews that are part of this flow.

73
00:04:33.119 --> 00:04:36.320
In our example, we're just going to have one crew in the flow,

74
00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.359
but you can build this flow to be as complex as you want.

75
00:04:39.359 --> 00:04:42.959
Remember, the idea here is opt-in agency,

76
00:04:42.959 --> 00:04:46.720
meaning that the flow just give you that backbone structure

77
00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.399
and you decide when and how much agency you want to bring

78
00:04:50.399 --> 00:04:54.399
from one single LLM call all the way to an entire crew.

79
00:04:54.399 --> 00:04:56.799
And the idea here is just to give you a structure

