00:05:41.359 --> 00:05:43.359
that has a listen decorator,

92
00:05:43.359 --> 00:05:46.480
and that is actually listening for our last function.

93
00:05:47.119 --> 00:05:52.079
So that means that as soon as the generate sentence count function is done,

94
00:05:52.079 --> 00:05:57.040
it will emit an event that will be picked up by the generated poem.

95
00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.239
And the generate poem would then execute its code

96
00:06:00.239 --> 00:06:05.119
and actually calls an entire crew that gets the number of sentences

97
00:06:05.119 --> 00:06:07.119
for creating a poem that is that long.

98
00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.279
And then again, you can see the listen decorator here being used again,

99
00:06:11.279 --> 00:06:15.519
but this time listening to the end of the generate poem function

100
00:06:15.519 --> 00:06:17.679
that would be the ending of the crew,

101
00:06:17.679 --> 00:06:23.440
and then executing the save poem function that will save that into a file.

