00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.600
Again, this is more of a simple use case,

103
00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.959
but it helps to highlight how you can build a flow

104
00:06:28.959 --> 00:06:32.880
and how simple it is to get this decorators going.

